d improvement works; and general building engineering designing and consulting services, as well as provides land transportation and other related services. In addition, the company operates as building and earthwork contractors, and sub-contractors. It serves the property developers, main contractors, government-linked corporations and concessionaires. Geohan Corporation Berhad was founded in 1996 and is headquartered in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Geohan Corporation Berhad 通过其子公司提供基础和岩土工程服务，成立于1996年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡。公司业务涵盖住宅、商业、工业项目建设和基础设施开发，并涉及建筑材料批发、设备租赁及相关工程服务。","lines":["基础和岩土工程：提供微型桩、传统打桩、基础托换、挡土结构、地基改良等工程服务，客户包括房地产开发商、主承包商、政府关联公司和特许经营商。","建筑施工：承建住宅、商业和工业项目，并开发基础设施，作为建筑和土方工程承包商及分包商。","建筑材料批发：批发建筑材料。","设备与机械租赁：提供设备和机械的租赁服务。","工程设计与咨询：提供一般建筑工程设计和咨询服务，以及陆路运输和其他相关服务。"],"lines_en":["Foundation and geotechnical services: micropiling, conventional piling, underpinning, earth retaining structures, ground improvement, serving property developers, main contractors, government-linked corporations and concessionaires.","Building construction: constructs residential, commercial, industrial projects and develops infrastructure, acting as building and earthwork contractors and sub-contractors.","Wholesale of construction materials: wholesale distribution of construction materials.","Equipment and machinery hiring: rental of equipment and machinery.","Engineering design and consulting: general building engineering design and consulting services, plus land transportation and other related services."]}}